<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compiled a collection of ten representative survey papers covering diverse research areas, as summarized in Table 7. Each topic reflects an active line of inquiry within machine learning and natural language processing, providing a strong foundation for evaluating literature review generation.</p>
